# Hizonelaundry is not this project

This repo is **HZN Laundry** (`hzn_laundry`). **Hi-Zone Laundry** (`hizonelaundry`) is a different product on the same CI/CD host. Never treat them as the same app.

## Never touch

- Hosts: `hizonelaundry.hznsystems.com`, `staging.hizonelaundry.hznsystems.com`, `*.hizonelaundry.sannjoseanimalclinic.com`
- Server dirs: `/opt/pocketbase/hizonelaundry/`, `/opt/pocketbase/hizonelaundry-staging/`
- Services: `pocketbase_hizonelaundry.service`, `pocketbase_hizonelaundry-staging.service`
- Caddy/DNS/email for those hostnames; do not redirect them to `hznlaundry`

## This project's hosts

- Production: `https://hznlaundry.hznsystems.com`
- Staging: `https://staging.hznlaundry.hznsystems.com`

Do not rsync hooks/migrations, restart PocketBase, or edit Caddy for `hizonelaundry*` when deploying this repo. If a path or hostname contains `hizonelaundry`, stop and confirm with the user.

```text
# BAD — Hi-Zone production (separate system)
rsync server/pb_hooks/ root@host:/opt/pocketbase/hizonelaundry/pb_hooks/

# GOOD — only this project's own PocketBase dirs/hosts (hznlaundry, not hizonelaundry)
```
